<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 149 days of 1997:</p>
<p>---------------------------1997------1996----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,761.....7,677......1.1</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,480.....3,474......0.2</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............834.......890.....-6.3</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,559.....1,563.....-0.3</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,634.....4,515......2.6</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,268....18,117......0.8</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,446.....6,497.....-0.8</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,689.....7,258......5.9</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......14,071....13,928......1.0</p>
